{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"better\": \"Y\",\n  \"regress\": \"有：Y对钢琴音色、声部变化、力度起伏和乐句走向的描写明显不如X具体，音乐本身的细腻质感有所损失。\",\n  \"nets\": {\n    \"scan\": \"X\",\n    \"point\": \"Y\",\n    \"why\": \"Y\",\n    \"whole\": \"Y\",\n    \"fine\": \"X\"\n  },\n  \"why\": \"Y更像一条能够跟得上的心理叙事，每段把人物的触发点、顾虑、行为和情绪变化讲得更清楚，尤其是S05、S09、S11、S13，人物为什么退缩、为什么又愿意靠近，都有明确的因果承接。X的短句、重点高亮和按乐句出现的感受词更利于快速扫读，音乐细节也更丰富，但部分感受词存在同义堆叠，水波、船、漂浮等意象反复解释相近的状态，容易分散注意力。综合普通观众听音乐时理解人物、跟住情节的实际收益，我选Y，但它牺牲了一部分X所具有的音乐描写精度。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "2b257b9b-86e6-491b-8e6b-3c5aa2c4a838", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt4\\pro-bridge-20261107T062441412123Z", "elapsed_seconds": 102.859, "completed_utc": "2026-11-07T06:26:24.273691+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "2f1ea6395355e9b36c2c5f0efba5446b0fbe7b01e42884eebd6652181690fc9d", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "Nozomi Kasaki / gpt4", "account_sha256": "bbd4fd636d4b6714d2b42b89e341bdb5bbe7c34f7d141aec76b444be8343fe54", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f